msgid "Instead of using the Stable or Master code branch for simulation, you can use and test your own branch, if desired. The steps are:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-realflight.rst:96
#: 65953614f65843d88072af3266f85802
msgid "Start RealFlight with the desired Realflight vehicle that has been modified for use with flightaxis."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-realflight.rst:97
#: 87bc58668f8d40198e4e2ce0821ee4a8
msgid "In your GITHUB repository (not local) push your branch to it"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-realflight.rst:98
